# Build context filter for deploy/docker/Dockerfile only (BuildKit: <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Allow-list: everything is excluded, then only what the V2 image needs is re-included.
# V1 files, .env, deploy/secrets/, .git and local virtualenvs never enter the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!migrations/
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
